  "question": "Within a radius of 160 kilometers, where can I locate caf\u00e9 heading toward Harrison Benwell Conservation Area, Wonder Lake, IL from Kindred Hospital Chicago Northlake, Northlake, IL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.89054 41.906867)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.332956 42.384311)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'cafe'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.89054 41.906867)',4326)::geography, 160000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.89054 41.906867)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
